IMAPAccount mrh57
Host posteo.de
User mrh57@posteo.net
PassCmd "gpg --quiet --for-your-eyes-only --no-tty --decrypt ~/.config/emacs/mbsyncpass.gpg"
Port 993
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs *
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore mrh57-remote
Account mrh57

MaildirStore mrh57-local
Path ~/mail/
Inbox ~/mail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel mrh57
Far :mrh57-remote:
Near :mrh57-local:
Patterns *
Create Near
Sync All
Expunge Both
SyncState *

# shell commands to run for init:
# $ mbsync --config ~/.config/isyncrc mrh57
# $ mu init --maildir=mail/ --my-address=mrh57@posteo.net
# $ mu index
